## Copyright notices missing from published packages

The published `oxc_*` packages (the JavaScript and TypeScript parser and its supporting crates) are MIT-licensed
but ship no licence file, so the generic MIT text above has no copyright line for them. The copyright notice of
the oxc project, from the `LICENSE` file in its repository (https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc, read on 22 Nov
2026), is:

```text
Copyright (c) 2024-present VoidZero Inc. & Contributors
Copyright (c) 2023 Boshen
```

This section is written by hand in `about.hbs`. When oxc is updated, check that its repository's `LICENSE` still
says the same.
